---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/parallel-agents-file-size-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/parallel-agents-file-size-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="By August, no fabricated resume was under 10 KB"
  caption="Resume file size on a log scale. Spring shows three individual resumes; August shows the range for the whole wave."
>
  Resume file sizes against the 10 KB line, on a log scale. In the spring rounds, two fabricated resumes were 8.5 and
  8.9 KB, and one real candidate's resume was 5.9 KB. In the August wave every resume was between 65 and 360 KB, and
  no fabricated application fell under 10 KB.
</Chart>
